<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sample Web PAge</title>
    
<style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 40px;
        }
        h1 {
            text-align: center;
        }
        .section {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        hr {
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>Welcome to My Website</h1>
    <p style="text-align:center;">A simple HTML demonstration page</p>

    <hr>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>About HTML</h2>
        <p>
            HTML stands for HyperText Markup Language. It is used to create web pages
            and structure content on the internet. HTML uses tags to define elements
            such as headings, paragraphs, lists, and links.
        </p>
    </div>

    <hr>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>My Hobbies</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Reading Books</li>
            <li>Playing Games</li>
            <li>Learning Programming</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <hr>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Daily Routine</h2>
        <ol>
            <li>Wake up</li>
            <li>Attend Classes</li>
            <li>Practice Coding</li>
            <li>Go to Sleep</li>
        </ol>
    </div>

    <hr>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Visit My Favorite Website</h2>
        <p>
            <a href="https://www.youtube.com" target="_blank">
                Click here to visit Youtube.
            </a>
        </p>
    </div>

    <hr>

    <footer style="text-align:center;">
        <p>© 2026 My Simple Website</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>